# {{title}}

Typst document: `main.typ` -> `main.pdf`.

- Build: `typst compile main.typ`. The PDF is git-ignored.
- Citations: cite with `@key` using only keys in `references.bib` (auto-exported from the user's Zotero collection). Never invent references or edit `references.bib` by hand.
- Typst cannot read files outside this folder; keep figures in `figures/`.
- Spelling is checked after each edit (typos); fix what it reports.
- VS Code profile: {{profile}}, in `.vscode/profile`. If the work changes (e.g. notebooks arrive), switch with `vsc --set <profile>` (`vsc --list` shows them); never open VS Code windows unless asked.
